WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:04.160
It is here at the Invictus Games
that you realize

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.360
whatever you carry,

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.880
it was the springboard
that propelled you to the next level.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.520
[cheering and applause]

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.000
[dramatic music playing]

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.360
[Harry] The Games doesn't focus
on what causes the injury,

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.800
but really about the recovery
and how to be part of a community again.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.760
[man] When I was a soldier,
that meant the world to me.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:30.600
Once I was wounded,
how do you define yourself then?

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.080
[in English]
I've been fighting a long time.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.320
- [man 1] Drinking a lot, going out a lot.
- [man 2] I have flashbacks.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.080
I would like to be the father
playing with his kids, playing football.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:56.600
[in English] 90% of my team
are currently serving four to five--

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:58.040
[explosion]

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.480
There is a shelling.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.600
[intense music playing]

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:02.960
- [crowd cheers]
- [whistle blows]

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.720
[Harry] If your goal
was to make your country proud,

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:08.760
you've done it.

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:10.040
How are we doing?

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.360
Everyone's gonna struggle at some point.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.800
I've got demons saying,
"You're not gonna do this."

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:18.520
[Harry] If your goal
was to make your family happy,

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:20.360
you've achieved it.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:21.920
My dad just scored there.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.760
Clearly someone sees something in me.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.640
[Harry] You are people of substance,

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:27.560
of resilience,

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:29.800
of strength.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.520
You have the Heart of Invictus.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:35.960
[crowd cheering]

